  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to Develop the Enabling Environment for Awqaf in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the TA project is to assist Uzbekistan in creating an enabling legal, regulatory and supervisory environment that is conducive for the establishment and development of Awqaf in the country. This will be achieved through developing legal, regulatory, institutional framework based on a comprehensive analysis of the current legislation, capacity constraints, main obstacles to introducing Awqaf, access and availability of information, legal barriers and political constraints. Furthermore, the project will ensure the development of regulation and guidelines to operationalize Awqaf in the country and raise awareness and build capacity for Awqaf development.</narrative>
  </description>
